<title>USA: 1st Bergen Bancorp to buy back stock.</title>
<headline>1st Bergen Bancorp to buy back stock.</headline>
<dateline>WOOD RIDGE, N.J. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>1st Bergen Bancorp said that under its previously approved management recognition and retention plans, it would repurchase up to four percent of its outstanding common stock in open market or privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>The company said these purchases will be used to fund grants.</p>
